messages.translation:
The installer package will be downloaded from the update source and handed to the system installer:

Source: {value}
Version: v{latest}
Platform: {value2}
File: {downloadName} ({sizeText})
Destination: updates/ in the app cache directory

Tap “OK” to start the download; once it finishes, the system installer takes over (Android asks once more on the system page — nothing is installed silently).
